*   *What to ask:* "Can we review my current management plan for Type 2 diabetes?"
*   *Why:* You mentioned managing your diabetes with calcium and vitamin D. These are typically used for bone health or parathyroid issues, whereas Type 2 diabetes is usually managed with medications like Metformin, insulin, or other blood-sugar-lowering drugs. 

