*   *What to ask:* "Can we make sure my records from Dr. Kim (Boston Respiratory) and Dr. Foster (Colorado Cardiology) are accurate and sent to Seattle Heart?"
*   *Why:* You noted that your Primary Care Physician is at a respiratory clinic and your endocrinologist is at a cardiology clinic. Ensuring Dr. Lee and Seattle Heart have the correct records from the correct departments will help them give you the best care. 

Writing these down and bringing them to your appointment with Dr. Lee next week will ensure you get the clarity you need!

